WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.721
"It finally stopped snowing," Harry said.

2
00:00:05.722 --> 00:00:10.528
"Let's go outside and play!" Oliver said.

3
00:00:10.529 --> 00:00:14.379
Mom had a better idea.

4
00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:19.571
"Let's go skiing!" she said.

5
00:00:19.572 --> 00:00:23.759
"But we don't have skis," Emmy said.

6
00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:26.898
"Don't worry," Dad said.

7
00:00:26.899 --> 00:00:30.301
"We can rent them."

8
00:00:30.302 --> 00:00:34.882
The Carters looked for their warmest clothes.

9
00:00:34.883 --> 00:00:42.326
"Wear your hats and mittens," Mom said.

10
00:00:42.327 --> 00:00:46.074
"Wear your snow pants and jackets," Dad said.

11
00:00:46.075 --> 00:00:49.131
"They'll keep you dry if you fall."

12
00:00:49.132 --> 00:00:53.099
The Carters drove to Winter Mountain.

13
00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.516
The ski resort was crowded.

14
00:00:57.517 --> 00:01:01.947
Dad led the family to the ski shop.

15
00:01:01.948 --> 00:01:07.923
"We need skis, boots, poles, and helmets," he said.

16
00:01:07.924 --> 00:01:13.005
A woman measured everyone.

17
00:01:13.006 --> 00:01:19.140
Then she handed out the ski equipment.

18
00:01:19.141 --> 00:01:22.384
"You're all set now," she said.

19
00:01:22.385 --> 00:01:25.429
"You can go skiing!"

20
00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:28.647
It took a while for everyone to get ready.

21
00:01:28.648 --> 00:01:37.303
At last they went outside.

22
00:01:37.304 --> 00:01:41.191
"Are we going on the ski lift?" Harry asked.

23
00:01:41.192 --> 00:01:43.977
"Or do we start on the beginner's slope?"

24
00:01:43.978 --> 00:01:47.038
"I don't know," Mom said.

25
00:01:47.039 --> 00:01:49.835
"I've never skied before."

26
00:01:49.836 --> 00:01:52.370
Dad looked surprised.

27
00:01:52.371 --> 00:01:56.380
"I've never skied before," he said to Mom.

28
00:01:56.381 --> 00:01:59.694
"I thought you knew how to ski!"

29
00:01:59.695 --> 00:02:01.819
Emmy turned around.

30
00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:05.419
She opened the door to the ski shop again.

31
00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:09.627
"We need to get one more thing," she said.

32
00:02:09.628 --> 00:02:18.552
"Lessons!" Oliver said.

